  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-22T22:40:00.359Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Changing the UI color (background + icons) is a neat feature that can help a lot of users with accessibility issues. Locking it behind VRC+ seems like a step in the wrong direction in regards to making the game accessible.\n\nAlternatively, having multiple presets for free users would give users an opportunity to have scaled back customization, but allow them to adjust the menu to be more comfortable for their own visual needs.\n\nAccessibility should never be put behind a paywall.",
